          },
          {
            "id": 2808865,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Good evening, everyone. Let me start by welcoming you all to this talk and thanking you for taking the time to consider joining ACE voluntary organisation. ACE offers support to people and services in the local area, and we're now looking for more volunteers to help us do this. By the way, I hope you're all comfortable. We have brought in extra seats so that no one has to stand, but it does mean that the people at the back of the room may be a bit squashed.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2808866,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Good evening, everyone.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 12.799999,
                  "from": 11.599999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2808870,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Let me start by welcoming you all to this talk and thanking you for taking the time to consider joining ACE voluntary organisation.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 22.525,
                  "from": 13.245,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2808894,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "ACE offers support to people and services in the local area, and we're now looking for more volunteers to help us do this.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 31.96,
                  "from": 23.085,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2808918,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "By the way, I hope you're all comfortable.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 35.239998,
                  "from": 32.68,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2808927,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We have brought in extra seats so that no one has to stand, but it does mean that the people at the back of the room may be a bit squashed.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 43.399998,
                  "from": 35.399998,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2808958,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "We'll only be here for about half an hour, so hopefully that's okay. One of the first questions we're often asked is how old you need to be to volunteer. Well, you can be as young as 16, or you can be 60 or over. It all depends on what type of voluntary work you want to do. Other considerations, such as reliability, are crucial in voluntary work, and age isn't related to these in our experience.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2808959,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We'll only be here for about half an hour, so hopefully that's okay.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 48.625,
                  "from": 43.825,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2808973,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "One of the first questions we're often asked is how old you need to be to volunteer.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 55.025,
                  "from": 49.185,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2808991,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Well, you can be as young as 16, or you can be 60 or over.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 60.71,
                  "from": 55.505,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2809007,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It all depends on what type of voluntary work you want to do.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 64.63,
                  "from": 60.95,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2809021,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Other considerations, such as reliability, are crucial in voluntary work, and age isn't related to these in our experience.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 74.41499,
                  "from": 65.19,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2809041,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Another question we get asked relates to training. Well, there's plenty of that, and it's all face to face. What's more, training doesn't end when you start working for us. It takes place before, during, and after periods of work. Often, it's run by other experienced volunteers as managers tend to prefer to get on with other things.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2809042,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Another question we get asked relates to training.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 79.055,
                  "from": 75.534996,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2809051,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Well, there's plenty of that, and it's all face to face.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 83.695,
                  "from": 79.615,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2809063,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "What's more, training doesn't end when you start working for us.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 88.42,
                  "from": 84.340004,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2809075,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It takes place before, during, and after periods of work.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 93.14,
                  "from": 88.58,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2809086,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Often, it's run by other experienced volunteers as managers tend to prefer to get on with other things.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 99.78,
                  "from": 93.54,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2809105,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Now I would ask you to consider a couple of important issues before you decide to apply for voluntary work. We don't worry about why you want to be a volunteer. People have many different reasons that range from getting work experience to just doing something they've always wanted to do. But it is critical that you have enough hours in the day for whatever role we agree is suitable for you. If being a volunteer becomes stressful, then it's best not to do it at all.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2809106,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Now I would ask you to consider a couple of important issues before you decide to apply for voluntary work.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 108.954994,
                  "from": 101.674995,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2809127,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We don't worry about why you want to be a volunteer.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 112.555,
                  "from": 109.354996,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2809139,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "People have many different reasons that range from getting work experience to just doing something they've always wanted to do.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 121.65,
                  "from": 113.170006,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2809160,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But it is critical that you have enough hours in the day for whatever role we agree is suitable for you.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 128.61,
                  "from": 122.05,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2809182,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "If being a volunteer becomes stressful, then it's best not to do it at all.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 134.71501,
                  "from": 129.595,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2809198,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "You may think that your income is important, but we don't ask about that. It's up to you to decide if you can work without earning money. What we value is dedication. Some of our most loyal volunteers earn very little themselves, but still give their full energy to the work they do with us.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2809199,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You may think that your income is important, but we don't ask about that.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 140.07501,
                  "from": 135.275,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2809214,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It's up to you to decide if you can work without earning money.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 143.91501,
                  "from": 140.395,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2809228,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "What we value is dedication.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 147.05,
                  "from": 144.49,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2809234,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Some of our most loyal volunteers earn very little themselves, but still give their full energy to the work they do with us.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 155.13,
